OL,4,CUS Army to carry out controlled blast  
OL,5,Cof degraded explosives in Iowa         
OL,6,GThe US Army is preparing to blow up    
OL,7,Gfive tonnes of degraded explosives in  
OL,8,GMiddletown, Iowa -.                    
OL,10,FThe controlled detonation of 68        
OL,11,Fbarrels of lead azide - a highly       
OL,12,Fvolatile compound - is necessary to    
OL,13,Fprevent an unplanned explosion, the    
OL,14,FArmy says.                             
OL,16,FIt is going ahead after an appeals     
OL,17,Fcourt overturned a decision to stop    
OL,18,Fthe blast over concerns about          
OL,19,Fpotential health hazards from lead     
OL,20,Fexposure.                              
